---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PingScene from '../../components/scenes/PingScene';
---

<BaseLayout title="Lab: ping" description="Test scene for the simulation hook and control bar.">
  <div class="prose mx-auto">
    <p class="meta">lab</p>
    <h1 class="text-[length:var(--fs-2xl)]">Ping</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      The smallest possible scene: one request, one reply. It exists to exercise the clock,
      the stepper and the scrubber before anything real sits on top of them.
    </p>
    <PingScene client:load />
    <p>
      Drag either slider while the picture is paused mid-flight. The dot stays at the same
      instant of virtual time and the geometry updates around it, because the frame is looked
      up from a rerun trace, not tweened from where it was.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
